Epilogue 2
Me: Are you ready to send them back to the past?
Scarlet: Yes. It's time to finally let go of all of this. I've seen enough of them for a lifetime.
Mr. Moon: Me as well?
Scarlet: Yes. I want to finally leave the past where it belongs. After all, I have to focus on what the future holds.
(t): I somehow feel proud of her.
Me: As you wish then. Any last words?
Scarlet looks at Amon and furrows her brows.
Then she looks at her father.
Scarlet: Goodbye.
The duke seems to understand and just nods.
After that, I shift them back to the past where they belong.
(t): I hope the prince ends up in jail or something. May he rot there until he dies.
Me: Okay. Now everything's done! We did it guys!
I throw my arms up in the air and Ray joins me.
Scarlet: There's one thing I want to ask.
I turn to her, thinking that I'm prepared for any question.
But it turns out that her question catches me off guard.
Scarlet: I know this might not be the best time to ask, but… Do you wan to go out with me?
One year later.
Today is the day.
(t): I can't believe it's finally happening!
We spent a whole year trying to plan our perfect wedding.
We had our quarrels here and there, but over all, I think that was the best year of my life.
(t): Who would have thought I would enjoy such a lovey-dovey life after changing the past and saving the world?
We decided to have the wedding in the gang's basement and just decorated the hell out of it.
It would be the perfect event to overwrite the unpleasant memories that linger in this place.
I fix my hair one last time and try to mentally prepare myself.
I'm startled to hear a knock at the door.
Me: Yes?
Seth enters the room.
Seth: She's ready.
I feel my heart pounding.
Me: I think I'm going to throw up my heart.
Seth smiles.
Seth: I think she might be feeling something similar right about now. Let's go.
I nod.
He leads me out to the hallway.
(t): Once I open this door… Help, I'm so nervous!
(t): I haven't seen Scarlet in her wedding dress yet. What if I faint???
I feel Seth's reassuring hand on my shoulder.
Seth: Are you ready? I'll open the door now.
I straighten up and nod.
(t): I'm ready! Ready for the happiest moment of my life!
Seth opens the door and I hold my breath.
ILLUSTRATION
Or rather, my breath is taken away.
I'm stunned by the beauty standing in front of me, smiling warmly at me.
Scarlet: You look mesmerising today.
I feel like cupid shot me with another arrow.
Me: Scarlet, you just landed a fatal blow on me.
She laughs.
Scarlet: What's that supposed to mean?
Me: It means you took my breath away with your beauty.
Seth has made his was over to the piano and starts playing music.
We walk to the makeshift altar at the end of the hall while Lu walks behind us, throwing flower petals.
Ray is waiting at the end of the hallway to serve as our priest today.
He also made a special wedding cake for us, with half of the cake being blood flavoured.
I'm glad we decided to make this wedding a private one like this, or we wouldn't have been able to have such a cake.
I look at Scarlet and see her twinkling eyes gazing back at me lovingly.
(t): This is our perfect vampire wedding.
